    <name>DocuSeal Integration</name>
    <summary>Integrate DocuSeal document signing with Nextcloud</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[
# DocuSeal Integration for Nextcloud

Send documents for signing directly from Nextcloud Files and automatically save signed documents back.

## Features
- Right-click on PDFs to send to DocuSeal
- Select from existing DocuSeal templates
- Add multiple recipients/signers
- Track signing status
- Automatic signed document retrieval
- Nextcloud notifications on completion

## Requirements
- DocuSeal instance (self-hosted or cloud)
- DocuSeal API key
    ]]></description>
